# Line endings.
#
# Without this, git converts on checkout and the working tree drifts from the index on a
# Windows machine: three conversations showed as modified with no change in them, which
# is noise that hides the diffs that matter.
#
# Vault content and source are normalised to LF in the repository. What lands on disk is
# git's business; what is committed should be the same bytes on every machine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Not text, and not diffable.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
